  "label": {
    "en": [
      "The postcard is a black and white photograph showing a serene river scene with rocky cliffs and dense forest on both sides. A person is rowing a small boat on the calm water. The image has handwritten text on the lower part, and printed red text reads 'Sundsvall' and 'Indalselfven – Döda fallet.' The publisher is listed as 'Imp. Flammen & Westerlund.'"
    ]
